@startuml View Product Details - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "ProductController" as ProductCtrl
participant "Product" as Product
participant "ProductComment" as Comment
participant "ProductRating" as Rating
participant "View" as View

== View Product ==
User -> ProductCtrl: show(product)
ProductCtrl -> Product: find(id)
Product --> ProductCtrl: product
ProductCtrl -> Comment: where(product_id)->with(user)
Comment --> ProductCtrl: comments
ProductCtrl -> Rating: where(product_id)->with(user)
Rating --> ProductCtrl: ratings
ProductCtrl -> View: show product.show(product, comments, ratings)
View --> User: display product details

@enduml
